cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the article below
  (see preferred-citation).
title: OntoUI
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rutesic
    given-names: Petko
repository-code: "https://github.com/ontosoft/onto-app-models"
abstract: >-
  OntoUI is an application generator that transforms SHACL shape graphs
  into multi-form web applications for populating knowledge graphs. The
  generated application models are themselves knowledge graphs (OBOP/BBO
  based), interpreted at runtime by a process engine that uses OWL
  reasoning and SHACL validation.
keywords:
  - SHACL
  - knowledge graphs
  - OWL reasoning
  - application generator
  - BPMN
  - ontology-based user interfaces
